Parallel Execution
------------------
    Stages run onb-by-one --> slow pipeline

    Solution:
    ---------
        Run independent stages at same time

        stage('Parallel Stage') {
            parallel {
                stage {
                    steps {
                        sh 'mvn clean package'
                    }
                }
                stage {
                    steps {
                        sh 'mvn clean package'
                    }
                }
            }
        }

    - only use when tasks are independent
    - if dependent --> keep sequential
